[H1]Overview:
Select the GPU architecture that matches your hardware. Each entry corresponds
to a specific GPU model. This allows you to install ROCm optimized for your
exact GPU model, reducing installation size compared to installing all models.
You can also choose to install all supported GPU architectures if preferred.

The installer supports fine-grained GPU architectures for precise matching.
For example, RDNA 3 GPUs have separate entries: gfx1100 (Navi 31), gfx1101
(Navi 32), and gfx1102 (Navi 33), allowing you to select the exact architecture
for your GPU.

